    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106314" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδᾰτό-χολος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watery and bilious in
				colour,</i> of excrements, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				67
			</span></i>; the reading <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδατόχλοα</span> is
			found in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιβ́</span> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).751
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.148
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				596
			</span></i>: cf. sq.</div>
